o&amp;nbsp;join our engineering team and grow into a&amp;nbsp;full-stack contributor, working alongside experienced engineers on&amp;nbsp;real client projects with modern, AI-augmented development workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll rotate across our client engagements, gaining hands-on exposure to&amp;nbsp;backend services, deployment pipelines, and modern development tooling in&amp;nbsp;production environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain backend features and services using Node.js under senior engineer guidance&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Support integration and troubleshooting of&amp;nbsp;CI/CD pipelines and containerized deployments&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Assist with frontend tasks and bug fixes across different framework stacks as&amp;nbsp;needed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use AI&amp;nbsp;coding tools and agentic workflows (harnesses, agent loops) as&amp;nbsp;part of&amp;nbsp;the daily development process&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Write clean, maintainable code and participate in&amp;nbsp;code reviews&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with cross-functional teams (backend, frontend, DevOps)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;0.5 years of&amp;nbsp;experience; hands-on practical skills are essential&amp;nbsp;— demonstrated through personal projects, coursework, or&amp;nbsp;self-study&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of&amp;nbsp;Node.js for backend development&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of&amp;nbsp;CI/CD concepts and deployment processes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Docker and containerization basics&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of&amp;nbsp;frontend development fundamentals (any framework)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Practical experience or&amp;nbsp;strong interest in&amp;nbsp;working with&amp;nbsp;AI development tools&amp;nbsp;— familiarity with concepts like agent harnesses and agent loops is&amp;nbsp;important&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Full-time availability (this role cannot be&amp;nbsp;combined with a&amp;nbsp;full academic course load)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and eagerness to&amp;nbsp;learn&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Upper-Intermediate English or&amp;nbsp;higher&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&amp;nbsp;Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Transparent strategy and thoughtful management that keep everyone aligned&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Space for personal growth and career development without limits&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A&amp;nbsp;culture of&amp;nbsp;continuous learning: internal courses, workshops, and English classes twice a&amp;nbsp;week&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Skill up&amp;nbsp;events where we&amp;nbsp;share experience and stay on&amp;nbsp;top of&amp;nbsp;trends&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Competitive perks: flexible schedule, a&amp;nbsp;strong compensation package, support for professional certifications, and generous vacation policy&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Team spirit that thrives through regular events, gatherings, and celebrations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 15:56:09 +0300</pubDate><guid>https://djinni.co/jobs/849641-trainee-node-js-developer-ai-augmented-develo/</guid><category>Node.js</category><category/></item></channel></rss>